$ unset TWO_TASK; sqlplus -S -L "/ as sysdba" @system_wallet_basic.sql
(VM: Oracle AI Database 26ai Free / OL8 ; DB 23.26.0.0.0 ; run as SYS ; 2026-09-23)

===== S0. environment =====
FREE / OPEN
Oracle AI Database 26ai Free Release 23.26.0.0.0 - Develop, Learn, and
wallet_root=(not set)

===== S1. no wallet (expect ORA-29024) =====
S1 no-wallet -> ERR -29273: ORA-29024: Certificate validation failure

===== S2. SET_WALLET('system') missing colon (expect ORA-29248) =====
S2 system(no colon) -> ERR -29273: ORA-29248: an unrecognized WRL was used to open a wallet

